WEBVTT

00:05:57.061 --> 00:06:01.148
a lot of investment
in growing it quantitatively.

00:06:01.816 --> 00:06:04.151
If we don't address the quality
dimension of it,

00:06:04.193 --> 00:06:07.655
we're going to grow a system
in which there's not going to be any trust

00:06:07.696 --> 00:06:09.907
or that trust is progressively
going to erode

00:06:09.949 --> 00:06:12.993
and ultimately that will destroy
the value of the system itself.

00:06:13.327 --> 00:06:15.913
DB: Sounds like something
called greenwashing.

00:06:15.955 --> 00:06:19.667
Can you give us some particularly
egregious examples

00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:21.627
of that kind of activity?

00:06:22.128 --> 00:06:24.046
GD: Yeah, I think, you know,

00:06:24.088 --> 00:06:26.549
carbon-neutral fossil fuels
is an obvious one ...

00:06:26.549 --> 00:06:29.718
(Laughter and applause)

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.304
... that many of you will certainly
have had heard of.